Moon License Scan selects contiguous lines from the upstream license and rule
files, removes trailing whitespace, assigns local rule IDs and SPDX labels,
and embeds the excerpts in its own data structure. The per-rule source path,
line range, full original-file SHA-256 and selection reason appear in
rule-sources/selection.tsv.

